thy with elevated serum antibody titer to influenza virus: case report of two patients</article-title><source>Med Sci Monit</source><year>2010</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>CS11</fpage><lpage>CS14</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Vikerfors</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Stjerna</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Olc&#x000e9;n</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Malmcrona</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Magnius</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><article-title>Acute myocarditis. Serologic diagnosis, clinical findings and follow-up</article-title><source>Acta Med Scand</source><year>1988</year><volume>223</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>52</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Ie</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubio</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name><name><surname>Alper</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Szerlip</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><article-title>Respiratory complications of pregnancy</article-title><source>Obstet Gynecol Surv</source><year>2002</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>39</fpage><lpage>46</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Kotaka</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kitaura</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Deguchi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawamura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><article-title>Experimental influenza A virus myocarditis in mice. Light and electron microscopic, virologic, and hemodynamic study</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>1990</year><volume>136</volume><fpage>409</fpage><lpage>419</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation pub